# 31. Authorization Middleware

Authorization chain:

```text
Authentication
      ↓
Account Type
      ↓
Permission
      ↓
Object Ownership / Scope
      ↓
Allow / Deny
```

Example:

```text
User
 ↓
GET /api/v1/user/complaints/:id
 ↓
Authenticated?
 ↓
User?
 ↓
Complaint belongs to this User?
 ↓
YES → Continue
NO  → Forbidden
```

---

# 32. Admin Authorization

Admin endpoint:

```text
/api/v1/admin/*
```

require:

```text
Authenticated
+
Admin account
+
Required permission
```

Admin-এর permission নেই এমন action deny হবে।

