# PART F — LOGGING & ERROR HANDLING

# 60. Logging Rules

Application logs structured হবে।

Log করা যাবে:

* request ID
* route
* method
* response status
* latency
* error category
* safe metadata

Log করা যাবে না:

* password
* raw access token
* refresh token
* secret
* sensitive evidence
* unnecessary personal information

---

# 61. Error Handling

Central error middleware:

```text
Request
 ↓
Error
 ↓
Central Error Handler
 ↓
Safe Client Response
 ↓
Internal Structured Log
```

Client-কে stack trace/secret/internal query information পাঠানো যাবে না।

---

# 62. Request Correlation

প্রতিটি request-এর:

```text
requestId
```

থাকবে।

এই ID:

* logs
* audit logs
* security events
* relevant error response

এর সঙ্গে সম্পর্কিত থাকতে পারে।

---

# PART G — SECURITY BOUNDARIES

# 63. Object-Level Authorization

Role authorization যথেষ্ট নয়।

Example:

```text
User A
 ↓
Complaint B
 ↓
Complaint B belongs to User A?
```

না হলে deny।

Admin একইভাবে permission এবং scope অনুযায়ী data access করবে।

---

# 64. Private Evidence Authorization

Private evidence access:

```text
Authenticated/Authorized Request
 ↓
Complaint/Evidence Permission
 ↓
Object Ownership/Staff Scope
 ↓
Signed URL
```

---

# 65. Public Evidence Authorization

যখন evidence:

```text
publicStatus = approved_public
```

তখন public-safe version accessible হবে।

Viewer login required নয়।

Viewer tracking নেই।

---

# 66. Session Security

Session internally track করা হবে।

User-এর জন্য active session list endpoint থাকবে না।

Privileged session revocation permission-controlled হবে।

Critical session/security operation audit করা হবে।

